      { label: 'Record half of it as a compromise', outcome: 'There is no compromise on accounting standards. Recording $100,000 of unearned revenue is just as fraudulent as recording $200,000. GAAP is not negotiable. This is how "small" frauds escalate into Enron-sized disasters.', correct: false }
