            { label: 'Avoid taking any position, the data is mixed', consequence: 'The data is not mixed. Collapsing gross margins and a 40% gap between revenue and cash collection are not ambiguous signals, they\'re screaming that the reported financials don\'t reflect economic reality. In investing, indecision in the face of clear evidence is costly.', score: 1 }
