      { label: 'Invest a small amount and monitor quarterly results', outcome: 'Investing even a small amount in a potential fraud is still losing money. Madoff\'s victims included sophisticated investors who thought they were doing due diligence. The better approach: do the forensic analysis BEFORE investing any amount.', correct: false }
