      { takeaway: 'Benford\'s Law and ratio analysis are powerful automated detection tools', detail: 'Natural financial data follows Benford\'s digit distribution. Revenue-cash flow divergence and receivable anomalies are the most reliable fraud red flags. These patterns appeared at Enron, WorldCom, Satyam, and Madoff.' },
      { takeaway: 'Fraud always leaves a trail in a double-entry system', detail: 'Every fake debit needs a fake credit. Over time, the imbalances compound. Follow the cash, not the profit: if profits are real, cash eventually follows. If cash never appears, the profits were likely fiction.' }
