        { date: '2016-2017', event: 'Toshiba sells Westinghouse nuclear unit, nearly faces delisting', context: 'The fraud aftermath forced Toshiba to sell its prized nuclear business and semiconductor division. Decades of corporate reputation destroyed. The inventory fraud was eventually traced to quarterly "challenges" from the CEO to meet targets, creating the pressure leg of the Fraud Triangle.' }
